# Build-context hygiene fix (2026-07-31): docker build has no way to know these
# project output/data directories aren't needed inside the image, and without this
# file it tars all of them into the build context — hundreds of GB, enough to fill
# /var (Docker's storage root) even though /mnt/data itself has plenty of space.
*_results/
*_logs/
data/
.snakemake/
.git/
TEMP/
TEMP_*/
*.qs
